  "description": "Kado is a bold and playful display typeface designed to bring strong personality and instant visual impact to your work. Featuring chunky letterforms, quirky details, and a friendly retro-inspired character, Kado works especially well when typography needs to become the main focus of a design.\nIts distinctive shapes make Kado perfect for posters, branding, packaging, food & beverage projects, merchandise, apparel, social media graphics, editorial layouts, stickers, and eye-catching headlines.\nFrom Japanese-inspired food posters and ramen branding to coffee shops, matcha packaging, streetwear, and playful lifestyle projects, Kado gives your designs a fun, confident, and memorable voice.\nDesigned by Amtypes.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Kado is a bold and playful display typeface designed to bring strong personality and instant visual impact to your work. Featuring chunky letterforms, quirky details, and a friendly retro-inspired character, Kado works especially well when typography needs to become the main focus of a design.</p>\n<p>Its distinctive shapes make Kado perfect for posters, branding, packaging, food &amp; beverage projects, merchandise, apparel, social media graphics, editorial layouts, stickers, and eye-catching headlines.</p>\n<p>From Japanese-inspired food posters and ramen branding to coffee shops, matcha packaging, streetwear, and playful lifestyle projects, Kado gives your designs a fun, confident, and memorable voice.</p>\n<p>Designed by Amtypes.</p>",
